{"id": "q0092", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2494721837, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "The caretaker of the docks needs to buy some new line. He wants 3 feet of line for every foot of dock. Right now, there is 200 feet of dock, and he has 6 feet of new line. How many feet of line does he need to buy in total?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0092.wav", "input_sha256": "04fd6f789b21f024f575aacbc061be0b1f1f9a108e29fd15a0135e0d03e281b6", "input_samples": 288800, "input_s": 18.05, "n_real_chunks": 19, "score": 0.276, "act": 0.9995, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Okay, so he needs three feet of line for every foot of dock. Right now there's 200 feet of dock and he has six feet of new line. So first we need to figure out how much line he needs in total. He needs three feet of line for every foot of dock, so that would be three times two hundred, which is six hundred feet of line needed in total. But he already has six feet of line, so we subtract that from the total amount he needs. Six hundred minus six is five hundred ninety-four. So he needs to buy five hundred ninety-four feet of line in total.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 29, "feed_lag_max_ms": 679, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1041, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0092_balanced_local.wav", "s