{"id": "q0495", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 232739410, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "创建一个程序将动物分类到不同的组中。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0495.wav", "input_sha256": "7b886e4768c29eb5cc29c2f6d4325794a5bbd188bb170da8d0c4e8eea3c8f8a4", "input_samples": 63400, "input_s": 3.962, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.3274, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "我们可以创建一个程序，把动物分类到不同的组里。比如说可以按食性分，比如肉食动物、植食动物和杂食动物。也可以按生活环境分，比如水生、陆生或飞行类动物。我们可以先建立一些动物的数据，然后根据特征把它们归到相应的类别中。这样不仅方便查看，还能帮助我们更好地理解动物的多样性。你觉得怎么样？", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 29, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0495_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "fe1ab326b12988cf911525526cbcfa44b495e336df4135e0001f8c8be9b3bde8", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 28.4}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.1, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.102, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.099, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.962, 4.022, 4.067, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.963, 5.023, 5.314, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.963, 6.022, 6.625, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.963, 7.022, 7.574, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.963, 8.022, 8.595, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.963, 9.022, 9.549, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.963, 10.023, 10.545, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.963, 11.023, 11.581, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.963, 12.023, 12.618, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.963, 13.024, 13.593, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.963, 14